{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1551","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"shared_bill_after_voucher","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Tiga buku nota berharga RM6.20 setiap satu dan empat batang pen berharga RM3.80 setiap satu. Selepas menggunakan baucar RM5, baki bayaran dibahagi sama rata antara dua rakan. Berapakah bayaran setiap orang?","options":["RM14.40","RM13.40","RM14.90","RM16.90"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah = 3 × RM6.20 + 4 × RM3.80 = RM33.80.","Selepas baucar: RM33.80 − RM5 = RM28.80.","Setiap orang = RM28.80 ÷ 2 = RM14.40."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1552","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mean_rises_after_new_value","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan lima nilai dengan purata 18. Satu nilai keenam ditambah dan purata enam nilai menjadi 19. Apakah nilai keenam itu?","options":["20","24","22","26"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah lima nilai = 18 × 5 = 90.","Jumlah enam nilai yang diperlukan = 19 × 6 = 114.","Nilai keenam = 114 − 90 = 24."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[14,18,22,16,20]}}
